Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.53,0:16:59.03,E,,0,0,0,,{\an4\fsp4\c&H555365&\fs54\fax-0.374147\fscx100.22\fscy100.14\frz-31.0246\frx5.4645\fry-0.8414\bord0\move(817,688,960,688)}表白
